+	  tagged t6 outside the routines for user memory, stops the kernel.
+
+config RISCV_CAPSTONE_TRAP_TEST
+	bool "Test loader and test hooks for the trap route"
+	depends on RISCV_CAPSTONE_TRAP
+	default n
+	help
+	  A test loader that turns the calling process into a protected
+	  program over two anonymous mappings, and a hook that holds a
+	  program reference in t6 across a sleeping page fault. Test only.
